---
output: svg
---
@startuml
' plantuml/plantuml#2834: broader coverage than reported_case.puml -- groups,
' notes and activation bars all add their own RealMax/RealMin/PositiveForce
' constraints on top of plain arrows, so this pins that those code paths are
' unaffected by the recursion-guard and creationPoint changes too.
!pragma teoz true
participant Alice
participant Bob
participant Carol

activate Alice
Alice -> Bob : request
activate Bob
note right of Bob
  a note wide enough to
  push the lifeline gauge
end note

alt success
  Bob -> Carol : forward
  activate Carol
  Carol --> Bob : ack
  deactivate Carol
else failure
  Bob --> Alice : error
end

loop retry
  Bob -> Alice : ping
end

deactivate Bob
deactivate Alice
@enduml
